2	 * ImportDispatch — the second student dispatch path.
3	 *
4	 * The student uploads a ForeFlight planning PDF; the backend extracts the
5	 * resolved flight (routes-dispatch-import.ts), and we map that
6	 * ExtractedForeFlightPlan onto a DispatchDraft and render the SAME shared
7	 * DispatchFlow the student dispatch + super-admin simulator use. Submitting
8	 * sends `scenarioInputs` (the canonical DispatchAssessmentPayload) so the
9	 * server scores the dispatch authoritatively (routes-locations.ts).
10	 *
11	 * Two-click happy path: (1) choose the PDF — upload + extract run
12	 * automatically — then (2) Score dispatch.
13	 */
